          "short": "Mode: $16, 19$; median: $19$; range: $23$; mean: $22.2$.",
          "worked": "Ordered data: $12,16,16,19,19,22,27,34,35$.\n\nBoth $16$ and $19$ occur twice, so the modes are $16$ and $19$. The fifth value is $19$, so the median is $19$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Range}&=35-12\\\\\\text{Range}&=23\\\\\\bar{x}&=\\frac{19+34+22+16+27+35+19+12+16}{9}\\\\\\bar{x}&=\\frac{200}{9}\\\\\\bar{x}&\\approx22.2\\quad\\text{(1 d.p.)}\\end{align*}$$",
